          "materialHash": "62cb0809566c20747531b4589b8bc07d2df84649d61395a8de5a14d48e95d66e",
          "textSource": "Public article text",
          "framing": {
            "en": "Centres Hindu Munnani’s accusation of deliberate obstruction and its demand for punishment. A speaker’s allegation is not a court finding of contempt.",
            "hi": "हिंदू मुन्नानी का जानबूझकर बाधा डालने का आरोप और सज़ा की माँग प्रमुख हैं। वक्ता का आरोप अदालत का अवमानना निष्कर्ष नहीं है।"
          }
        },
        {
          "publisherGroup": "organiser",
          "publisher": "Organiser",
          "url": "https://organiser.org/2026/11/26/429071/bharat/tamil-nadu/thiruparankundram-deepathoon-row-fresh-contempt-plea-seeks-to-establish-vijay-government-role-in-defying-sc-order/",
          "title": "Thiruparankundram Deepathoon Row: Fresh contempt plea seeks to establish role of Vijay government in defying SC order",
          "publishedAt": "2026-11-26T09:00:36+00:00",
          "materialHash": "3247630d92719698c9b7aeec73fc877151044ae27ab84308be3c609249a1b050",
          "textSource": "Public article text",
          "framing": {
            "en": "Examines a fresh contempt petition and requests for official records. A request to establish ministerial involvement does not establish that involvement.",
            "hi": "नई अवमानना याचिका और सरकारी रिकॉर्ड की माँग प्रमुख है। मंत्री की भूमिका जानने की माँग, भूमिका का सबूत नहीं है।"
          }
        },
        {
          "publisherGroup": "tfipost",
