          "url": "https://scroll.in/latest/1097290/tamil-nadu-defies-sc-order-on-lighting-lamp-at-disputed-pillar-atop-thiruparankundram-hill",
          "title": "Tamil Nadu defies SC order on lighting lamp at disputed pillar atop Thiruparankundram hill",
